OL,3,AVance calls Michigan Senate candidate
OL,4,AEl-Sayed 'evil' at campaign rally
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS Vice-President JD Vance has
OL,7,Fdescribed Senate candidate Abdul
OL,8,FEl-Sayed as "a very, very evil" person
OL,9,Fat a campaign rally in Michigan,
OL,10,Faccusing him of being a divisive
OL,11,Ffigure.
OL,13,FHe also warned El-Sayed to "keep my
OL,14,Fwife's name the hell out of your
OL,15,Fmouth", after the candidate appeared to
OL,16,Fsuggest that Vance's late grandfather
OL,17,Fwould not accept Second Lady Usha
OL,18,FVance, who is Hindu.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
