OL,3,AVance calls Michigan Senate candidate
OL,4,AEl-Sayed 'evil' at campaign rally
OL,5,
OL,6,FEl-Sayed shot back at Vance later on
OL,7,FMonday, accusing the Trump
OL,8,Fadministration of pushing "evil"
OL,9,Fpolicies and "starting wars abroad when
OL,10,Fthere's peace".
OL,12,FThe 41-year-old candidate is facing
OL,13,FTrump ally Mike Rogers in what has
OL,14,Fquickly become a senate race
OL,15,Fcharacterised by personal attacks and
OL,16,Finsults between the two.
